  "body": "More Space. More Flexibility. More Value.\r\n\r\nA generously sized 58m² one-bedroom + study offering considerably more versatility than your typical one-bedroom apartment.\r\n\r\nThe standout is the large separate study complete with its own wardrobe, creating an incredibly flexible additional space - ideal as a home office, guest room, nursery or additional storage.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n- Generous 58m² internal floor area\r\n- Spacious separate bedroom\r\n- Large separate study with wardrobe\r\n- Open-plan kitchen, dining & living\r\n- Modern bathroom\r\n- Excellent work-from-home flexibility\r\n- Ideal for first-home buyers, professionals or investors\r\n- Excellent school zones including Takapuna School, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, Belmont Intermediate, Takapuna Grammar School & Westlake Girls' High School\r\n- Prime Takapuna location with easy access to the beach, cafés, shopping, public transport and motorway connections\r\n\r\nA one-bedroom apartment that gives you the extra space you normally have to step up a category to get.\r\n\r\nContact Mitchell Eades on 021 255 8573 to arrange a private viewing.",
